{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 部分感受词条切得过碎，连续出现时容易让注意力在多个意象之间跳转，削弱叙述的流畅感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的括号高亮能让人迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，而分时出现的感受又能跟着音乐逐步展开，不必一次读完所有信息。更重要的是，它反复扣住了「受过的气」「被当作自己人」「害怕孤单」这几条心理线索，最后落到带着想念继续生活、不再为了留住谁而忍受委屈，人物的变化有清楚的来由。Y 的完整句子读起来更顺，但右侧感受容易变成密集的情绪词清单，核心动机和音乐细节之间的对应也不如 X 鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d307dcf4-fce9-4db3-937c-0c91a2481087", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194950992292Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:51:06.777280+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa51442252a7e4517d2c6e867edc8c88423cbcf4c17cf9426f7828422136cd0e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3